{'symbol': 'CAT', 'date': '2021-07-30 06:30:00', 'title': 'CATERPILLAR REPORTS SECOND-QUARTER 2021 RESULTS', 'text': 'DEERFIELD, ILL., JULY 30, 2021 /PRNEWSWIRE/ -- SECOND-QUARTER 2021 SALES AND REVENUES INCREASED 29% TO $12.9 BILLION SECOND-QUARTER 2021 PROFIT PER SHARE OF $2.56; ADJUSTED PROFIT PER SHARE OF $2.60 STRONG BALANCE SHEET; RETURNED $0.8 BILLION TO SHAREHOLDERS THROUGH DIVIDENDS AND SHARE REPURCHASES \xa0 SECOND QUARTER ($ IN BILLIONS EXCEPT PROFIT PER SHARE) 2021 2020 SALES AND REVENUES $12.9 $10.0 PROFIT PER SHARE $2.56 $0.84 ADJUSTED PROFIT PER SHARE $2.60 $1.27 CATERPILLAR INC. (NYSE: CAT) TODAY ANNOUNCED SECOND-QUARTER 2021 SALES AND REVENUES OF $12.9 BILLION, A 29% INCREASE COMPARED WITH $10.0 BILLION IN THE SECOND QUARTER OF 2020.'}